                <pb facs="0670" n="582" xml:id="pg582"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Newberry.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-08-15"><hi rendition="#italic">August 15,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 365.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have received your No. 504 of 28th
                    ultimo, relative to the interference of the authorities of Aleppo and those of
                    Alachan with certain officers of the American Bible Society.</p>
                <p>Your efforts to protect the rights of these American citizens meet with
                    approval.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
